@startuml
title 持久化、工具与异常类图 — Iteration 2（最终）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam wrapWidth 170
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 38
hide empty members
hide circle
left to right direction

package "persistence" {
  interface "Repository<T extends Identifiable>" as Repository {
    + findAll(): List<T>
    + findById(long): Optional<T>
    + save(T): T
    + delete(long): void
    + saveAll(): void
    + findAll(Predicate<T>): List<T>
    + findFirst(Predicate<T>): Optional<T>
  }

  interface "CsvCodec<T extends Identifiable>" as CsvCodec {
    + header(): String[]
    + parse(String[]): T
    + format(T): String[]
    + idOf(T): long
    + withId(T, long): T
  }

  class "CsvRepository<T extends Identifiable>" as CsvRepository {
    - file: Path
    - codec: CsvCodec<T>
    - store: Map<Long,T>
    - lineNumbers: Map<Long,Integer>
    - nextId: long
    + file(): Path
    + header(): String[]
    + lineOf(long): int
    + load(LoadDiagnostics): void
    + findAll(): List<T>
    + findById(long): Optional<T>
    + save(T): T
    + delete(long): void
    + saveAll(): void
    + removeInMemory(long): void
    - writeAtomically(): void
  }

  class DataLoader {
    + loadAll(): void
    - validateEmployees(): void
    - validateClasses(): void
    - validateClassCourses(): void
    - validateStudents(): void
    - validateScores(): void
  }

  class DataInitializer {
    + ensureLayout(Path): void
    + isFresh(): boolean
    + seedDemoData(): void
    + ensureAdmin(): void
  }

  class LoadDiagnostics {
    + add(String, int, String, String): void
    + recordStats(String, int, int): void
    + updateLoaded(String, int): void
    + hasIssues(): boolean
    + issueCount(): int
    + writeTo(Path): void
    + printSummary(PrintStream): void
  }

  class LoadIssue <<record>> {
    + file: String
    + line: int
    + category: String
    + summary: String
  }

  class DepartmentCsvCodec
  class EmployeeCsvCodec
  class CourseCsvCodec
  class SchoolClassCsvCodec
  class ClassCourseCsvCodec
  class StudentCsvCodec
  class ScoreCsvCodec
}

package "util" {
  class CsvUtil {
    + escape(String): String
    + split(String): String[]
    + join(String[]): String
  }
  class PasswordHasher {
    + generateSalt(): String
    + hash(String, String): String
    + verify(String, String, String): boolean
  }
  class Validators {
    + requireUsername(String): String
    + requirePassword(String): void
    + requireName(String): String
    + optionalDescription(String): String
    + optionalPhone(String): String
    + optionalEmail(String): String
    + requireCode(String, String): String
    + requireDate(String): LocalDate
    + requireScore(String): double
    + requireCapacity(String): int
    + requireId(String, String): long
  }
  class Dates {
    + parseDate(String): LocalDate
    + formatDate(LocalDate): String
    + parseDateTime(String): LocalDateTime
    + formatDateTime(LocalDateTime): String
    + now(): LocalDateTime
  }
}

package "exception" {
  class BusinessException {
    + BusinessException(String)
  }
  class DataAccessException {
    + DataAccessException(String)
    + DataAccessException(String, Throwable)
  }
}

CsvRepository ..|> Repository
CsvRepository --> CsvCodec
CsvRepository --> CsvUtil
CsvRepository --> LoadDiagnostics
CsvRepository ..> DataAccessException : 读写失败

DepartmentCsvCodec ..|> CsvCodec
EmployeeCsvCodec ..|> CsvCodec
CourseCsvCodec ..|> CsvCodec
SchoolClassCsvCodec ..|> CsvCodec
ClassCourseCsvCodec ..|> CsvCodec
StudentCsvCodec ..|> CsvCodec
ScoreCsvCodec ..|> CsvCodec

DataLoader --> CsvRepository : 7 个实体仓储 + 诊断
DataLoader --> LoadDiagnostics
DataInitializer --> CsvRepository : 建文件 / 写种子
DataInitializer --> PasswordHasher : 生成演示账号
DataInitializer --> LoadDiagnostics

LoadDiagnostics --> LoadIssue
BusinessException --|> RuntimeException
DataAccessException --|> RuntimeException

note right of CsvCodec
  7 个实现，每个实体一个 Codec：
  Department / Employee / Course /
  SchoolClass / ClassCourse / Student / Score。
  相当于每个实体的 Strategy。
end note

note bottom of DataLoader
  加载顺序：departments → employees → courses
  → classes → class_courses → students → scores。
  引用缺失的实体只从内存移除，不写回文件；
  成绩按 (studentId, courseId) 校验唯一性，
  重复行保留首条并记入 LoadDiagnostics。
end note

note bottom of DataInitializer
  仅在全新数据目录时写入演示数据；
  部分初始化只补文件/表头和管理员兜底账号。
end note

note bottom of CsvRepository
  每个实体一个 CSV 文件；
  写入走“临时文件 + 原子替换”，
  启动/退出各一次全量落盘。
end note

note right of LoadDiagnostics
  日志只写时间戳、文件名、行号、
  错误类别与安全摘要，
  不写整行内容、密码、哈希或联系方式。
end note

@enduml
